---

<Layout>
   <h1>ABOUT US</h1>
    <section class="about-us-section">
        <div>
        <img src=`/src/img/a1_result.webp` 
     alt="eventbillede">
     </div> 
     <div>
     <h3>WHO WE ARE</h3>
     <p>We're a creative community for all kind of designers meeting in inspiring space and connecting through relaxed conversations about design and the creative word. We create opportunities for creative people to connect, exchange ideas and inspire one another across different disciplines and backgrounds. Through events, workshops, talks and meetups, we bring people together through a shared interest in design and the creative industry.</p>
     </div>

       <div>
         <h3>WHAT WE DO</h3>
     <p>We organize events, talks and workshops focused on design, creativity, innovation and the evolving creative industry. Our events give participants the opportunity to meet inspiring people, gain new perspectives and become part of a network where ideas and experiences are shared freely. Whether you are an established designer, a student or simply curious about the creative world, there is a place for you at KindDesign.</p>
     </div>
     <div>  
     <img src=`/src/img/a2_result.webp` 
     alt="eventbillede">
     </div>
     
        <div>
        <img src=`/src/img/a3_result.webp` 
     alt="eventbillede">
     </div>
     <div>
     <h3>OUR PURPOSE</h3>
     <p>Our purpose is to strengthen connections between people in the creative world. We believe that the best ideas emerge when people come together, share experiences and challenge each other's perspectives. That's why we aim to create an open and inclusive space where there is room for professional growth, curiosity, creative exploration and meaningful connections.</p>
     </div>

      <div>
         <h3>OUR VISION</h3>
     <p>Our vision is to build a strong and vibrant creative community where people inspire one another, build connections and grow together. For us, design is not just about what we create - it is also about the people, ideas and relationships that emerge along the way.</p>
      </div>
         <div>   
     <img src=`/src/img/a4_result.webp` 
     alt="eventbillede">
     </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

